ARMORED FIRE.

1ST TROOP AND 3RD TROOP ARE ORDERED TO PROCEED NORTH THROUGH
OPFOR CONTROLLED TERRITORY. YOUR MISSION OBJECTIVE IS TO REACH
2ND TROOP AT HILL TANGO-175 IN SECTOR 3.

ALL FIELDED AMERICAN UNITS ARE DESIGNATED TARGETS. 

BE ADVISED, MLF FORCES HAVE SATURATED OUTLYING ZONES WITH
MINEFIELDS AND REINFORCED BUNKERS. THEIR GOAL IS TO PRESS 1ST 
AND 2ND TROOPS DOWN WHAT HAS BEEN DESIGNATED WIDOW'S PASS. 

GRU OPERATIONS HAVE GIVEN A VERY BRIEF OPERATIONAL WINDOW FOR THE
COMPLETION OF THIS MISSION.
